1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,469
Communities have overlapping plans in
different systems.

2
00:00:04,469 --> 00:00:08,538
Springforth deduplicates them into
coordinated, funded action.

3
00:00:08,538 --> 00:00:12,607
This is the live deployment — the landing
page opens with what needs attention right
now.

4
00:00:14,907 --> 00:00:19,442
Across imported plans — OnePlanet, a county
CSV, Treegens field records, Silvi —

5
00:00:19,442 --> 00:00:23,975
the overlap layer flags where strategies
collide or complement.

6
00:00:23,975 --> 00:00:28,509
Each record carries confidence, evidence,
counter-evidence,

7
00:00:28,509 --> 00:00:33,043
and humans validate: separate, coordinate,
or combine.

8
00:00:35,344 --> 00:00:39,094
Two rounds, same three needs. Standard
quadratic on the left.

9
00:00:39,094 --> 00:00:42,845
Pairwise on the right — the three donors who
appreciated each other get discounted:

10
00:00:42,845 --> 00:00:46,596
$232.84 versus ~$263.

11
00:00:46,596 --> 00:00:50,346
The appreciation graph is the sybil signal —

12
00:00:50,346 --> 00:00:54,097
no external passport, no staking token.

13
00:00:54,097 --> 00:00:57,847
Collusion costs you; diversity pays.

14
00:01:00,148 --> 00:01:04,256
Every delivery action gets scored by
independent public sources:

15
00:01:04,256 --> 00:01:08,364
Sentinel-2 scene coverage, GBIF biodiversity
records, NASA weather, Treegens filmed
trees.

16
00:01:08,364 --> 00:01:12,472
A field report corroborated by satellite
earns the reporter an assurance credit —

17
00:01:12,472 --> 00:01:16,579
measure-to-earn.

18
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:21,332
The outcome becomes a hypercert-shaped
impact claim

19
00:01:21,332 --> 00:01:23,784
with an EAS attestation.

20
00:01:23,784 --> 00:01:26,236
Every chain route returns unsigned calldata
—

21
00:01:26,236 --> 00:01:28,688
wallets sign, nothing custodies.

22
00:01:30,988 --> 00:01:35,072
Protocol parameters are tuned by ballot,
gated by EigenTrust standing —

23
00:01:35,072 --> 00:01:39,156
the social graph is the franchise, not a
token.

24
00:01:39,156 --> 00:01:43,240
This proposal already passed and rewrote the
matching coefficient.

25
00:01:43,240 --> 00:01:47,324
And signed data releases, anchored to
Bitcoin — the data-revenue lane.

26
00:01:49,624 --> 00:01:52,280
This card sits at two of three. Join —

27
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:54,936
— quorum reached, commitment bound,

28
00:01:54,936 --> 00:01:57,591
the declaring group gets pinged on Telegram.

29
00:01:57,591 --> 00:02:00,248
People AND required resources — that's what
quorum means.

30
00:02:06,124 --> 00:02:09,633
Every decision hash-chained, the head
anchored to Bitcoin via OpenTimestamps.

31
00:02:09,633 --> 00:02:13,142
The full API is documented with a typed
client —

32
00:02:13,142 --> 00:02:16,652
this is infrastructure others build on.

33
00:02:18,951 --> 00:02:21,989
Overlapping plans to coordinated, funded
action —

34
00:02:21,989 --> 00:02:25,026
with collusion resistance grown from the
coordination itself.

35
00:02:25,026 --> 00:02:28,063
Springforth. PS1. Team Two.

